  "details": "On avatars with disabled headchop, there is a narrow threshold distance where it will still be scaled to zero anyway. Closer or farther than this and it will correctly remain un-scaled.\n\nThis causes the head to briefly blink in and out as it passes this narrow range.\n\nVideo of behavior: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Qxcp6R5TcGY",
